# Elusive Otter (1/1): "Creatures with power less than this creature's power can't block it". On turn 3 Bot2's Ornithopter (power 0)
# may not block it (the control, as in elusive-otter-cant-be-blocked-by-a-creature-with-less-power), and the Otter hits for 1. Bot2's
# The Wondrous Wasp strips the Otter of every ability on turn 4, the restriction with them: on turn 5 the Ornithopter blocks it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Elusive Otter
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Ornithopter
The Wondrous Wasp
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elusive Otter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Elusive Otter > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter > Bot1.Battlefield.Elusive Otter)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.The Wondrous Wasp.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Target(Elusive Otter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Elusive Otter > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter > Bot1.Battlefield.Elusive Otter)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
